                              resource applies to. If you set this field, then the Reserve
                              applies to all Entities in the Org.'}
                          division: {}
                          partition: {}
                          level:
                            description: |
                              The hierarchical level for this reserve setting.

                              <details>
                              <summary>Valid Values</summary>

                              - `admin` - System-wide admin

                              - `division` - Partition-wide admin

                              - `merchant` - Division-wide admin

                              - `partition` - Merchant user

                              </details>
                            enum: [admin, division, merchant, partition]
                            x-enum-descriptions: ['', '', '', '']
                          entity: {description: The identifier of the Entity that this
                              Reserve applies to.}
                          hold: {}
                          name: {description: The name of this Reserve. This field is
                              stored as a text string and must be between 1 and 100
                              characters long.}
                          description: {description: A description of this Reserve.
                              This field is stored as a text string and must be between
                              0 and 100 characters long.}
                          percent: {description: 'The percentage of funds to reserve,
                              expressed in basis points. For example, 25.3% is expressed
                              as ''2530''.'}
                          release:
                            description: The schedule that determines when the funds
                              in this Reserve should be released defines valid values
                              for automated release, including never, days, weeks, months,
                              and years.
                            enum: [never, days, weeks, months, years]
                            x-enum-descriptions: [Never., Daily. The funds are released
                                every day., Weekly. The funds are released every week.,
                              Monthly. The funds are released every month., Annually.
                                The funds are released every year.]
                          releaseFactor: {description: 'A multiplier that you can use
                              to adjust the schedule set in the ''release'' field, which
                              is specified as an integer and its value determines how
                              the schedule is multiplied.'}
                          start: {description: 'The date on which this Reserve resource
                              should start reserving funds from the Entity or Org. The
                              date is specified as an eight digit string in YYYYMMDD
                              format, for example, ''20160120'' for January 20, 2016.'}
                          finish: {description: 'The date on which this Reserve resource
                              should stop reserving funds from the Entity or Org. The
                              date is specified as an eight digit string in YYYYMMDD
                              format, for example, ''20160120'' for January 20, 2016.'}
                          max: {description: The maximum amount to reserve.}
                          inactive:
                            description: Whether this resource is marked as inactive
                              or not.
                            enum: ['0', '1']
                            x-enum-descriptions: [Active, Inactive]
                          frozen:
                            description: Whether this resource is marked as frozen or
                              not frozen.
                            enum: ['0', '1']
                            x-enum-descriptions: [Not frozen, Frozen]
                    details:
